WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:07,960
But I know

2
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:12,190
He's Miko's ex-boyfriend

3
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,670
Leave this man on the mountain

4
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:15,390
Instead, I will carry you down alone.

5
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,210
I won't be saved by Miko either

6
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:18,610
One by one on the forum

7
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,010
Is it all true?

8
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,210
I don't know

9
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:24,610
But at least this matter is settled

10
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,210
Sure enough, I guessed it right

11
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,610
Miko is on Qingling Mountain

12
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:29,410
Saved Lu Ling

13
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:30,610
Excuse me then

14
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,610
There is talk about Miko on the forum

15
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:35,010
Was it about saving you on the mountain? If not, wouldn't that mean

16
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,810
Those crazy people in school

17
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:37,810
About me and Miko

18
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,210
It's only half a piece

19
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:42,580
What does this have to do with saving me?

20
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,900
Miko did a good thing

21
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,900
You can't leave your name either

22
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,300
Things to do while hiking in Qingling Mountain

23
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,700
It was Miko who suggested it.

24
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,100
It was he who asked Jiang Mu to take me to the hospital first.

25
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,500
He just sent us away

26
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,900
The back foot will save you
